000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RRDSDISP.
000300* The standard asks only that a RELATIVE KEY be an unsigned
000400* integer data item. VSAM addresses an RRDS by a fullword record
000500* number, so a key that is already one is used in place and any
000600* other integer is converted through the compiler's own cell
000700* around each request. This one is USAGE DISPLAY.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT RRDS-FILE ASSIGN TO RRDSF01
001200         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001300         ACCESS IS RANDOM
001400         RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
001500         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001600 DATA DIVISION.
001700 FILE SECTION.
001800 FD  RRDS-FILE
001900     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002000     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002100 01  RRDS-RECORD                 PIC X(80).
002200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002300 01  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
002400 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
002500 01  SEEN                        PIC X(20).
002600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002700 000-MAIN.
002800     OPEN INPUT RRDS-FILE.
002900     DISPLAY 'OPEN   ' WS-STATUS.
003000     MOVE 3 TO WS-RRN.
003100     READ RRDS-FILE.
003200     MOVE RRDS-RECORD TO SEEN.
003300     DISPLAY 'REC 3  ' WS-STATUS ' [' SEEN ']'.
003400     MOVE 1 TO WS-RRN.
003500     READ RRDS-FILE.
003600     MOVE RRDS-RECORD TO SEEN.
003700     DISPLAY 'REC 1  ' WS-STATUS ' [' SEEN ']'.
003800     MOVE 99999 TO WS-RRN.
003900     READ RRDS-FILE.
004000     DISPLAY 'REC 99 ' WS-STATUS.
004100     CLOSE RRDS-FILE.
004200     DISPLAY 'CLOSE  ' WS-STATUS.
004300     STOP RUN.
